description=While Xiaomi Interconnect PC mirroring (com.xiaomi.mirror SinkPCActivity) is in front: panel unmanaged + 3x3 matrix fitted to the factory P3 3D LUT, so a Mac rendering the "Xiaomi Pad" display in Display P3 is shown in P3. Restores colour setting and matrix afterwards.
